# Training Tuning & Diagnostics

Read the rule matching your current task:

- **Launch / resume / stop a run** (GPU env setup, `gpu_env.sh`, nohup launch, monitoring, clean stop): see `training-launch`
- **Hyperparameter selection** (c_puct, network depth/width, lr, KataGo exponential `temperature_schedule`, Dirichlet, opponent pool by game type): see `training-hyperparams`
- **Prevent overconfidence** (policy prior collapse vs value outcome memorization, triage table, sample reuse `< 1.0`, layered prevention & rollback checklist): see `training-overconfidence`
- **Selfplay exploration / policy lock-in** (`opening_exploration`, KataGo `midgame_start` + tournament fork, exponential `root_policy_temperature`, adaptive/shaped `dirichlet_total_alpha`, `prior_ent` / `policy_kl` logs): see `training-exploration`
- **Diagnose issues** (symptom-to-cause checklist, concurrent inference setup, banned legacy keys, known BUGs): see `training-diagnostics`
- **Selfplay throughput** (bottleneck diagnosis, workers / leaf batching, fp16, TensorRT, memory): see `training-performance`
- **KataGo-style techniques** (playout cap randomization, FPU reduction, score / score-breakdown auxiliary heads, weight EMA): see `training-katago-techniques`
